      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "text": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1\">\n  <title>Terra Test Outfitters — gear for the field</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"A local test page for HAR-PLUS with metadata, structured data, forms, images and a cross-site iframe.\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Eleventy v3.0.0\">\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http://127.0.0.1/\">\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Terra Test Outfitters\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"/img/big.jpg\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\">\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/img/favicon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/app.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"http://localhost:55158/theme.css\">\n  <script type=\"importmap\">{ \"imports\": { \"badge\": \"/badge.js\" } }</script>\n  <script type=\"module\" src=\"/main.js\"></script>\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n  {\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Terra Test Outfitters\",\"url\":\"http://127.0.0.1/\",\n   \"telephone\":\"+1-555-0100\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/example\",\"https://github.com/example\"]}\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"/app.js\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header><a href=\"/\">Home</a> <a href=\"/page2.html\">Page two</a> <a href=\"mailto:hello@example.com\">Email</a></header>\n  <main>\n    <h1>Gear for the field</h1>\n    <h3>Skipped a level</h3>\n    <p>Read our <a href=\"/missing-page\">click here</a> guide, the <a href=\"/old\">old catalogue</a>, or jump to <a href=\"#nowhere\">the specs</a>.</p>\n    <p>Some copy about tents, stoves and a <hp-badge>custom element</hp-badge>.</p>\n    <hp-card class=\"card card--featured\">Shadow DOM card</hp-card>\n    <div id=\"\" class=\"u-flex\"></div><span id=\"dup\">one</span><span id=\"dup\">two</span>\n    <dialog id=\"hello\">Hi</dialog>\n    <div popover id=\"tip\">Tip</div>\n    <img src=\"/img/hero.svg\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\">\n    <img src=\"/img/hero.svg\" alt=\"Fallback test\" id=\"onerror-img\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\">\n    <form action=\"/subscribe\" method=\"post\">\n      <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\">\n      <button></button>\n    </form>\n    <iframe src=\"http://localhost:55158/frame.html\" width=\"300\" height=\"80\"></iframe>\n    <img src=\"/img/big.jpg\" alt=\"Trail at dawn\" style=\"width:300px\">\n    <p class=\"promo\">Spring sale</p>\n    <ul class=\"tags\"><li>Free shipping</li><li>New arrivals</li><li>Members save</li></ul>\n    <p lang=\"ar\">مرحبا بكم في متجرنا. نقدم الشحن المجاني على جميع الطلبات داخل المدينة. اكتشف معدات التخييم والمشي لمسافات طويلة لدينا. عروض خاصة لأعضاء النادي كل أسبوع.</p>\n    <div style=\"height:2400px\"></div>\n    <img src=\"/img/lazy.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Lazy image far below the fold\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\">\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
     },
